{"channelId":"UCW1JFqPmNAN9vgbi_kIZOHg","row":["VET IAS",2880,"VET Institute of Arts and Science (VET IAS), the youngest member of the Vellalar family is an intellectual community that nurtures student learning, fosters faculty research and creative activity, and provides service to the larger community. We, at VET IAS emphasize on collaborative learning, individual intellectual development, and respect for diverse points of view, preparing students to become critical thinkers, strong communicators and ethical leaders with a truly global perspective.\n\nOur students will graduate understanding that what they do beyond the classroom can make an impact on the world since knowledge, understanding and intellectual courage for a purposeful life in a challenging and changing world are woven into the fabric of their education.\nVET Institute of Arts and Science, Erode.","","India"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCW1JFqPmNAN9vgbi_kIZOHg","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCW1JFqPmNAN9vgbi_kIZOHg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:03:48.938Z","channelId":"UCW1JFqPmNAN9vgbi_kIZOHg","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"d5838d6a3284929e3b72dbedd3c27c418fb2b0f90eb59ecfd2649258baacee65","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"46dd18c1f72724b7a73e9be6684b3f091c4225ffce0b1726c575995452e3040e"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCW1JFqPmNAN9vgbi_kIZOHg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:03:48.938Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCW1JFqPmNAN9vgbi_kIZOHg","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":2880,"raw":"2.88K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCW1JFqPmNAN9vgbi_kIZOHg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:03:48.938Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"veterinary","relevant":true,"evidenceLevel":"profile","role":"undetermined","flags":